; claude: the page as a document: read, styled and laid out, every stage
; kept (Browser_page), its scripts and the DOM they see (Browser_script:
; the tasks, over Script_dom, the page's mutable copy, and Script_host,
; the host objects; their types in Script_types),
; its forms' clicks and keys (Browser_forms).
(library
 (name browser_www)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules_without_implementation script_types) ; types alone
 (flags (:standard -open Network)) ; ours, not the Playground's (libs/network/dune)
 (libraries
   lang_html lang_css javascript browser_layout
   appkit_typeset ; Linebreak, for wrap=pretty
   browser_url browser_display
   network)) ; Urlencoded, a form's query
